@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+---
+id: dl-001-treat-delivery-as-vat-exempt
+type: decision-log
+title: "Treat delivery as VAT-exempt"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+The service currently treats delivery as standard-rated for VAT, adding €1.08 to a €4.90 shipment.
+Anna reports that delivery is a service and must not have VAT added. This conflicts with the existing
+VAT rule in the README and affects order totals, receipts, and invoice VAT summaries.
+
+## Decision
+
+Treat delivery as VAT-exempt. Delivery VAT is always zero and delivery must not appear as taxable
+standard-rate value in invoice VAT summaries.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Orders and receipts no longer charge or display a non-zero delivery VAT amount. Invoices report VAT
+only for goods. Documentation and regression tests must describe and verify the revised rule.
